d:hover:backdrop-blur-none md:hover:bg-primary-100 transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3"><a href="/" class="flex items-center z-10 transform translate-x-3 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-950 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 rounded" aria-label="Beeldzorgteam home"><svg viewBox="0 0 2900 300" fill="none" width="280" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="transition-colors text-primary-950 hover:text-primary-900" data-v-b67484bd=""><text x="0" y="50%" dominant-baseline="central" text-anchor="start" font-family="system-ui, sans-serif" font-weight="900" font-size="260" fill="currentColor" letter-spacing="0">BEELDZORGTEAM.NL</text></svg></a><nav class="w-fit flex flex-row items-center gap-1 hidden md:flex" role="navigation" aria-label="Desktopnavigatie" data-v-cc455ec7><button class="z-10 relative inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-4 py-3 leading-none text-primary-900 no-underline text-sm font-medium transition-colors rounded-full nav-link transform active:scale-95 after:absolute after:left-0 after:right-0 after:top-full after:h-4 after:content-[&#39;&#39;] bg-primary-200" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" data-v-cc455ec7> Platform <span class="iconify i-ph:zorgt-down w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform duration-200" aria-hidden="true" style="" data-v-cc455ec7></span></button><button class="z-10 relative inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-4 py-3 leading-none text-primary-900 no-underline text-sm font-medium transition-colors rounded-full nav-link transform active:scale-95 after:absolute after:left-0 after:right-0 after:top-full after:h-4 after:content-[&#39;&#39;]" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" data-v-cc455ec7> Toepassingen <span class="iconify i-ph:zorgt-down w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform duration-200" aria-hidden="true" style="" data-v-cc455ec7></span></button><a href="/partners" class="z-10 relative inline-block px-4 py-3 leading-none  text-primary-900 no-underline text-sm font-medium transition-colors rounded-full nav-link transform active:scale-95 hover:bg-primary-200" aria-label="Navigeer naar Partners" data-v-cc455ec7>Partners</a><a href="/contact" class="z-10 relative inline-block px-4 py-3 leading-none  text-primary-900 no-underline text-sm font-medium transition-colors rounded-full nav-link transform active:scale-95 bg-primary-950 !text-primary-50 ml-2" aria-label="Navigeer naar Contact met ons opnemen" data-v-cc455ec7>Contact</a><!----></nav><button class="md:hidden p-2 rounded-md transition-colors z-10 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 text-primary-950 hover:text-primary-800 hover:bg-primary-100 focus-visible:ring-primary-950" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-navigation"><div class="w-6 h-6 relative flex items-center justify-center"><span class="absolute w-5 h-0.5 bg-current rounded-full transition-all duration-300 ease-out -translate-y-1"></span><span class="absolute w-5 h-0.5 bg-current rounded-full transition-all duration-300 ease-out translate-y-1"></span></div></button></div></div></nav><!----><!--]--><div class="min-h-screen bg-primary-50"><section class="py-8 md:py-24 pt-24 pb-8 md:pb-16 md:pt-40"><!--[--><div class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4"><!--[--><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center"><!----><div class="mb-4"><span class="inline-block font-medium rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-800 px-3 py-1 text-xs">In Uw Eigen Huisstijl</span></div><h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl tracking-tight font-medium text-primary-950 mb-6 text-balance">Uw eigen kleuren, logo en merkidentiteit geïntegreerd in de hele patiëntervaring.</h1><p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-primary-700 text-balance mb-8">Maak een naadloze ervaring voor uw patiënten met uw eigen logo en merkkleuren, overal in de portal.</p><div><!--[--><a href="/contact" class="cursor-pointer leading-none inline-flex items-center justify-center font-medium transition-all focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-3 md:py-3 bg-primary-950 text-primary-50 rounded-full hover:bg-primary-900 focus-visible:ring-primary-950 active:scale-95 text-base"><!--[--> Neem contact op <!--]--><!----></a><!--]--></div></div><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></section><section class="py-8 md:py-24"><!--[--><div class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4"><!--[--><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="w-full"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:justify-between gap-2 lg:gap-6 text-pretty"><div class="flex flex-col items-start text-left flex-1"><span class="inline-block font-medium rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-800 px-3 py-1 text-xs mb-3">Problem</span><h2 class="text-2xl md:max-w-[24ch] tracking-tight md:text-4xl font-medium text-primary-950 mb-3">Je kunt niet verbeteren wat je niet ziet</h2><!----></div><!----></div></div><div class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-base text-primary-700"><p> Tussen afspraken door is er weinig zicht op hoe het gaat. Tegen de tijd dat een trend duidelijk is, zijn er al weken verstreken. </p><p> Beeldzorgteam verzamelt gestructureerde data bij elke interactie. Alles wordt automatisch bijgehouden voor het zorgteam. </p></div><div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 md:gap-12"><!--[--><div class="flex flex-col text-pretty"><span class="text-3xl md:text-5xl text-primary-950 tracking-tight font-[300]">70%</span><h3 class="font-medium text-primary-900 mt-4">Therapieuitval na eerste bezoeken</h3><p class="text-sm text-primary-700 mt-1">Meer dan 70% van alle uitval in de geestelijke gezondheidszorg vindt plaats na het eerste of tweede bezoek, voordat er therapeutische vooruitgang kan worden geboekt.</p><a href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC8265313/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline items-center gap-1 font-medium text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-950 transition-colors text-xs mt-auto tracking-tight pt-2"><!--[-->World Mental Health Surveys / PMC<span>, 2021</span><!--]--><span class="iconify i-ph:arrow-up-right relative transform translate-y-[2px] translate-x-[1px] w-3 h-3" aria-hidden="true" style=""></span></a></div><div class="flex flex-col text-pretty"><span class="text-3xl md:text-5xl text-primary-950 tracking-tight font-[300]">43%</span><h3 class="font-medium text-primary-900 mt-4">Artsen ervaren burn-out klachten</h3><p class="text-sm text-primary-700 mt-1">43,2% van de artsen meldde ten minste één burn-outsymptoom in 2024. Degenen met onvoldoende documentatietijd hebben 2,8 keer meer kans op een burn-out.</p><a href="https://www.ama-assn.org/practice-management/physician-zorg/doctors-work-fewer-hours-ehr-still-follows-them-home" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline items-center gap-1 font-medium text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-950 transition-colors text-xs mt-auto tracking-tight pt-2"><!--[-->AMA / Mayo Clinic Proceedings<span>, 2024</span><!--]--><span class="iconify i-ph:arrow-up-right relative transform translate-y-[2px] translate-x-[1px] w-3 h-3" aria-hidden="true" style=""></span></a></div><div class="flex flex-col text-pretty"><span class="text-3xl md:text-5xl text-primary-950 tracking-tight font-[300]">&lt;1%</span><h3 class="font-medium text-primary-900 mt-4">De tijd die de patiënt doorbrengt in een klinische omgeving</h3><p class="text-sm text-primary-700 mt-1">Met een gemiddeld bezoek van 20 minuten en 2 tot 4 bezoeken per jaar besteden cliënten minder dan 1% van hun tijd aan een arts en de rest besteedt alleen aan de zorg.</p><a href="https://www.amnzorgzorg.com/blog/physician/locums/average-time-doctors-spend-with-cliënten/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline items-center gap-1 font-medium text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-950 transition-colors text-xs mt-auto tracking-tight pt-2"><!--[-->Annalen van de interne geneeskunde<span>, 2024</span><!--]--><span class="iconify i-ph:arrow-up-right relative transform translate-y-[2px] translate-x-[1px] w-3 h-3" aria-hidden="true" style=""></span></a></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></section><section class="py-8 md:py-24"><!--[--><div class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 mb-12 md:mb-16"><!--[--><div class="w-full"><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-balance"><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center"><!----><h2 class="text-2xl md:max-w-[24ch] tracking-tight md:text-4xl font-medium text-primary-950 mb-3">Van ruwe reacties naar klinische signalen</h2><p class="text-base text-primary-700 md:max-w-[60ch] text-balance">Every Beeldzorgteam interaction feeds into a unified analytics layer. No manual data entry, no spreadsheet exports.</p></div><div class="mt-6"><!--[--><a href="/contact" class="cursor-pointer leading-none inline-flex items-center justify-center font-medium transition-all focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-3 md:py-3 bg-primary-950 text-primary-50 rounded-full hover:bg-primary-900 focus-visible:ring-primary-950 active:scale-95 text-sm"><!--[-->Neem contact op<!--]--><!----></a><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--><!----></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 md:gap-16 w-full"><div class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4"><!--[--><div class="space-y-16 md:space-y-24 w-full"><!--[--><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-20 items-center"><div class="max-w-md"><span class="inline-block font-medium rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-800 px-3 py-1 text-xs mb-4">Engagement</span><h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium text-primary-950 mb-4 text-pretty">Know who&#39;s engaged and who&#39;s going quiet</h3><p class="text-base text-primary-700 text-balance">Track open rates, completion rates, and response patterns across every Beeldzorgteam and workflow. Declining engagement surfaces automatically so your team can follow up before cliënten disengage completely.</p><!----></div><figure class=""><div class="bg-primary-100 rounded-xl aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden"><img data-nuxt-img srcset="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbeeldzorg_insights.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 1x, /_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbeeldzorg_insights.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="Know who&#39;s engaged and who&#39;s going quiet" class="w-full h-full object-contain" src="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbeeldzorg_insights.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100"></div></figure></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-20 items-center"><div class="md:order-2 max-w-md"><span class="inline-block font-medium rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-800 px-3 py-1 text-xs mb-4">AI Inzicht</span><h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium text-primary-950 mb-4 text-pretty">Door AI aangedreven analyses die naar boven brengen wat belangrijk is</h3><p class="text-base text-primary-700 text-balance">AI beoordeelt de reacties van patiënten om trends te benadrukken die een menselijke beoordelaar mogelijk over het hoofd zou zien. Sentimentanalyse, geautomatiseerde samenvattingen, detectie van afwijkingen en voorgestelde acties zorgen ervoor dat artsen sneller kunnen handelen met minder handmatige beoordeling.</p><!----></div><figure class="md:order-1"><div class="bg-primary-100 rounded-xl aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden"><img data-nuxt-img srcset="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbeeldzorg_rtm_2.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 1x, /_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbeeldzorg_rtm_2.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="Door AI aangedreven analyses die naar boven brengen wat belangrijk is" class="w-full h-full object-contain" src="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbeeldzorg_rtm_2.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100"></div></figure></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-20 items-center"><div class="max-w-md"><span class="inline-block font-medium rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-800 px-3 py-1 text-xs mb-4">Symptom Trends</span><h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium text-primary-950 mb-4 text-pretty">Longitudinale symptoomtracking over domeinen heen</h3><p class="text-base text-primary-700 text-balance">Reacties die zijn getagd met symptoomdomeinen zoals de ernst van angst, functionele impact en emotionele regulatie, worden in de loop van de tijd geclassificeerd als verbeterend, stabiel of afnemend. Artsen zien trends, geen geïsoleerde datapunten.</p><!----></div><figure class=""><div class="bg-primary-100 rounded-xl aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden"><img data-nuxt-img srcset="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbeeldzorg_rtm_2.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 1x, /_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbeeldzorg_rtm_2.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="Longitudinale symptoomtracking over domeinen heen" class="w-full h-full object-contain" src="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbeeldzorg_rtm_2.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100"></div></figure></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-20 items-center"><div class="md:order-2 max-w-md"><span class="inline-block font-medium rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-800 px-3 py-1 text-xs mb-4">Risk Flags</span><h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium text-primary-950 mb-4 text-pretty">Betreffende patronen kwamen naar boven voor het volgende bezoek</h3><p class="text-base text-primary-700 text-balance">When a patient&#39;s trend shifts from stable to declining, or engagement drops significantly, the system flags it. Clinicians review flagged cliënten first, focusing time where it matters most.</p><!----></div><figure class="md:order-1"><div class="bg-primary-100 rounded-xl aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden"><img data-nuxt-img srcset="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbeeldzorg_insights.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 1x, /_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbeeldzorg_insights.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="Betreffende patronen kwamen naar boven voor het volgende bezoek" class="w-full h-full object-contain" src="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbeeldzorg_insights.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100"></div></figure></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-20 items-center"><div class="max-w-md"><span class="inline-block font-medium rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-800 px-3 py-1 text-xs mb-4">Evidence View</span><h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium text-primary-950 mb-4 text-pretty">Ruwe reacties georganiseerd voor klinische beoordeling</h3><p class="text-base text-primary-700 text-balance">The evidence view pulls a patient&#39;s responses across all Nudges and workflows into a single timeline. Clinicians see what the patient said, when they said it, and in what context.</p><!----></div><figure class=""><div class="bg-primary-100 rounded-xl aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden"><img data-nuxt-img srcset="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbeeldzorg_insights.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 1x, /_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbeeldzorg_insights.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="Ruwe reacties georganiseerd voor klinische beoordeling" class="w-full h-full object-contain" src="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbeeldzorg_insights.jpg&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100"></div></figure></div><!--]--></div><!--]--><!----></div></div><!--]--></section><section class="py-8 md:py-24 bg-primary-100/50"><!--[--><div class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4"><!--[--><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-6 gap-8 md:gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-center"><figure class="order-2 md:col-span-4 space-y-4 md:space-y-6"><blockquote class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl xl:text-4xl max-w-full sm:max-w-[40ch] font-medium text-primary-900 text-pretty tracking-tight [&amp;_i]:not-italic [&amp;_i]:bg-gradient-to-r [&amp;_i]:from-primary-200/70 [&amp;_i]:to-primary-300/70 [&amp;_i]:px-1 [&amp;_i]:-mx-1 [&amp;_i]:rounded [&amp;_i]:box-decoration-clone [&amp;_i]:border-r-4 [&amp;_i]:border-primary-400">"Vroeger moesten we gissen welke cliënten het moeilijk hadden. Nu loggen onze artsen in en <i>de data is er al</i>, georganiseerd op trend en risiconiveau. Het heeft compleet veranderd hoe we klinische aandacht verdelen binnen de praktijk."</blockquote><figcaption class="md:order-2"><cite class="text-sm sm:text-base font-medium text-primary-950 not-italic">Ralph Van der Pol</cite><p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-primary-600">Oprichter Beeldzorgteam</p></figcaption><a href="https://kuduzorg.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="inline-block"><img data-nuxt-img srcset="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fkuduzorg-logo.png&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 1x, /_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fkuduzorg-logo.png&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="Anthony Como company logo" class="h-3 sm:h-4 w-auto transition-opacity hover:opacity-70" src="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fkuduzorg-logo.png&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100"></a></figure><div class="order-1 md:col-span-2"><div class="bg-primary-200 rounded-xl aspect-square md:aspect-auto md:h-full w-full overflow-hidden"><img data-nuxt-img srcset="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fralph-van-der-pol.webp&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 1x, /_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fralph-van-der-pol.webp&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="Ralph Van der Pol" class="w-full h-full object-cover" src="/_amplify/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fralph-van-der-pol.webp&amp;w=1536&amp;q=100"></div></div></div><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></section><section class="py-8 md:py-24"><!--[--><div class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4"><!--[--><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 lg:gap-8"><h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl tracking-tight text-balance font-medium text-primary-950 max-w-4xl">Zie hoe uw patiëntgegevens tot leven komen</h2><p class="text-lg lg:text-xl text-primary-700 max-w-2xl text-balance">Boek een demonstratie en we laten u zien hoe Beeldzorgteam elke patië